	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Vidi inquisitionem <placeName ref="l875">Hispano</placeName><placeName ref="l822">germanicam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>compater in domino charissime, quam huc legendi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>gratia misisti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Olfeci nequiciam monachorum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>recordatusque sum verborum <persName ref="p18722">Erasmi</persName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>anno 1533 ad <persName>Ioannem Cholerum</persName>, praepositum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiensem</placeName>, qui tum <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> quoque <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>praepositus erat apud S. Mauricium, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ad hunc modum scripsit:</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">"Video plane <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>futurum, ut, si inclinent res Luteranorum, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>exoriatur tanta tyrannis monachorum, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ut simus desideraturi <persName ref="p1974">Luterum</persName>."</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Res <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Luteranorum in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> sane vehementer <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>inclinant, et tyrannis ista <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>monachorum, quam C[aesar] pietatem verę <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>religionis esse iudicat, non solum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>iam exoritur, sed grassatur etiam, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et hanc arbitror esse causam, ob <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quam regina <persName ref="p18215">Maria</persName> ex <placeName ref="l18">Augustanis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>comitiis ex improviso ad <placeName ref="l20">Batavos</placeName> suos <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>redire compulsa est; feruntur enim <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>proceres ipsius iique praecipui a facie <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tyrannidis huius aufugisse interea, dum C[ae<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sar] et ipsa nescio quae in comitiis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>istis moliuntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Clades illa, quam per temeritatem suam incurr<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>erunt <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName>, dum consiliis comitis <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>a <placeName ref="l1716">Mansfeld</placeName> non obtemperarunt, maior est, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quam literae tuae habent.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nam <foreign xml:lang="el">ὁ Σπερτλίνος</foreign> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>hisce diebus ea de re ad me scripsit, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quae ex nobili quodam Misnico accepit <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ad hunc modum:</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">"Weither bericht er <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mich, das denen von <placeName ref="l303">Magdenburg</placeName> vonn <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>burgern und knechten bis in die 600 per<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>sonen umb seyen komen vonn hertzog <persName ref="p20427">Jergen <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>von Meckelburg</persName> dem jüngeren, welches vater <persName ref="p18424">her[<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>tzog] Albrecht</persName> allwegen widder das evangelium <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>und gut kayß[erisch] gesyn.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Aber der alt <persName>hertzog <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Heinrich</persName> ist gut unserer religion unnd <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>rych, dißer verdorben.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Ir mögt wol glauben, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>das solche <persName>h[ertzog] Heinrichen</persName> und dises handlungen <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>alle uß kay[serlichem] kocher unnd der pfaffen <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>seckel unnd anschlegen angericht werden, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>in vorhaben, die christenleut muͤd zu machen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Der allmechtig verleyhe bessers.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Doch <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>seyen die von <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburg</placeName> (denen auch <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>der graf von <placeName ref="l1716">Manßfeld</placeName> und andere <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>dißen ußfall widerratten) noch steif und <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>manlich.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Summa, es sindt kriegsübungen; <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>solche gaben gabt man in solchem bretspil.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Die vonn <placeName ref="l1041">Brunschwig</placeName> und der hertzog haben <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>mer dann zu einem scharrmützel in beden <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>theilen biß in die 800 oder 900 mann <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>einander erlegt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Sunt generalia contraria.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Der bapst hatt <persName ref="p20318">h[ertzog] Heinrichen</persName> 7 fenlin knecht <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>versoldet, und er, der hertzog, ist jetz zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z28"/><placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName> und wurt gegen denen vonn der <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>stat verhöret; die senndt auch mitt 21 <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>pferden allda ankhomen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l303">Magdenburg</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>und <placeName ref="l61">Bremen</placeName> seind vergleitet <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>zu verhör uff 2. novembris.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Haec ille <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>ad me 21. octobris, ex quibus facile <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>videre est, quid clades illa <placeName ref="l303">Magdebur<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>gensis</placeName> effecerit.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Timeo exemplum vic<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>i<lb xml:id="p3z2"/>no<lb xml:id="p3z3"/>rum <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>vestrorum <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensium</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quare <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>orandus dominus est, ut det illis civitatibus <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>non solum fortitudinis, sed et syncerę <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>communionis et consensus summopere <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>necessarii spiritum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l701">Mechelburgensis</placeName> ille <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>nihil horum tentasset, si civitates istę <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>maiori inter se consensu ac fide <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>cohęsissent.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Et quem consensionis <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>spiritum illis apprecor, eundem apprecor <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>et nostris hisce evangelicis <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>rebuspublicis et ecclesiis.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Virtus <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>unita fortior est se ipsa dispersa; <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>scopis dissolutis nihil est roboris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p3z17"/>Optime vale, compater in domino charissime.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z18"/>Pestis hic haud quidem pleno impetu <lb xml:id="p3z19"/>grassatur, verum sic serpit, ut subinde <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>non paucos abripit idque ex vicinis <lb xml:id="p3z21"/>nostris.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Quare in horas expectamus <lb xml:id="p3z22"/>manum visitantis nos patris <lb xml:id="p3z23"/>nostri coelestis, id quod ideo scribo, <lb xml:id="p3z24"/>ut nos precibus vestris gratię illius <lb xml:id="p3z25"/>commendetis.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta dom<lb xml:id="p3z26"/>inos a<lb xml:id="p3z27"/>c fratres omnes d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p3z28"/>d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> et reliquos fratres <lb xml:id="p3z29"/>et amicos.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 2. novembris 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z30"/><persName ref="p8417">W[olfgangus] Musculus</persName>, compater <lb xml:id="p3z31"/>tuus in domino.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Clarissimo theologo <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>m. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>ecclesię pastori <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>diligentissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>ac compatri suo <lb xml:id="p4z7"/>charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
